        },
        {
          "id": "1786970832252",
          "from": "Itzel Chavez",
          "from_upn": null,
          "sent_utc": "2026-08-17T12:47:12.252Z",
          "sent_mt": "2026-08-17T06:47:12-06:00",
          "text": "This has been resolved.",
          "importance": "normal",
          "web_url": null
        },
        {
          "id": "1786971173701",
          "from": "Itzel Chavez",
          "from_upn": null,
          "sent_utc": "2026-08-17T12:52:53.701Z",
          "sent_mt": "2026-08-17T06:52:53-06:00",
          "text": "We have a lot of dirty molds inside the system. We will try to replace them all with clean ones.",
          "importance": "normal",
          "web_url": null
        },
        {
          "id": "1786971688641",
          "from": "Itzel Chavez",
          "from_upn": null,
          "sent_utc": "2026-08-17T13:01:28.641Z",
          "sent_mt": "2026-08-17T07:01:28-06:00",
          "text": "Metal detector belt on TG5 is damaged, and getting ripped.",
          "importance": "normal",
          "web_url": null
        },
        {
          "id": "1786971734920",
          "from": "Itzel Chavez",
          "from_upn": null,
          "sent_utc": "2026-08-17T13:02:14.92Z",
          "sent_mt": "2026-08-17T07:02:14-06:00",
          "text": "TG5 will be down until maintenance comes over to inspect the belt.",
          "importance": "normal",
          "web_url": null
        },
        {
          "id": "1786971780198",
          "from": "Mirella Mamani",
          "from_upn": null,
          "sent_utc": "2026-08-17T13:03:00.198Z",
          "sent_mt": "2026-08-17T07:03:00-06:00",
          "text": "Approximately one bar for every 3 molds has candy exposure, there is currently a person removing these bars",
          "importance": "normal",
          "web_url": null
        },
        {
          "id": "1786971859545",
          "from": "Preston Tregaskis",
          "from_upn": null,
          "sent_utc": "2026-08-17T13:04:19.545Z",
          "sent_mt": "2026-08-17T07:04:19-06:00",
          "text": "Itzel Chavez do you think this could be caused by the dirty molds you mentioned earlier?",
          "importance": "normal",
          "web_url": null
        },
        {
          "id": "1786971978480",
          "from": "Itzel Chavez",
          "from_upn": null,
          "sent_utc": "2026-08-17T13:06:18.48Z",
          "sent_mt": "2026-08-17T07:06:18-06:00",
          "text": "Yes! Thats the reason, the system was left with dirty molds inside.",
          "importance": "normal",
          "web_url": null
        },
        {
          "id": "1786972056951",
          "from": "Preston Tregaskis",
          "from_upn": null,
          "sent_utc": "2026-08-17T13:07:36.951Z",
          "sent_mt": "2026-08-17T07:07:36-06:00",
          "text": "Gotcha, sounds like you're already removing the molds and have an ee pulling the affected bars, thank you.\n \nDo you have an estimate of how long we'll keep seeing them?",
          "importance": "normal",
          "web_url": null
        },
        {
          "id": "1786972129951",
          "from": "Preston Tregaskis",
          "from_upn": null,
          "sent_utc": "2026-08-17T13:08:49.951Z",
          "sent_mt": "2026-08-17T07:08:49-06:00",
          "text": "And shouldn't the system have caught those mold and skipped the deposits?",
          "importance": "normal",
          "web_url": null
        },
        {
          "id": "1786972124427",
          "from": "Itzel Chavez",
          "from_upn": null,
          "sent_utc": "2026-08-17T13:08:44.427Z",
          "sent_mt": "2026-08-17T07:08:44-06:00",
          "text": "To get rid of all the dirty ones it will take 1 whole round which is like 60-75 min.",
          "importance": "normal",
          "web_url": null
        },
        {
          "id": "1786972262479",
          "from": "Itzel Chavez",
          "from_upn": null,
          "sent_utc": "2026-08-17T13:11:02.479Z",
          "sent_mt": "2026-08-17T07:11:02-06:00",
          "text": "Yes but all these dirty molds were already in the preheating cabinet marked as good since Friday, we turned on the vision system this morning.",
          "importance": "normal",
          "web_url": null
        },
        {
          "id": "1786972295245",
          "from": "Preston Tregaskis",
          "from_upn": null,
          "sent_utc": "2026-08-17T13:11:35.245Z",
          "sent_mt": "2026-08-17T07:11:35-06:00",
          "text": "Ah okay. Thanks for the quick troubleshooting.",
          "importance": "normal",
          "web_url": null
        },
        {
