          "sent_mt": "2026-08-16T15:47:02-06:00",
          "text": "Maria Moron Quintero, we finished Friday's York run with 2 rolls of flow wrap remaining (approximately 40k wraps). This is about 1 hour of run time. We will be starting the level 3 clean on ML3 Monday morning as the schedule shows.",
          "importance": "normal",
          "web_url": null
        },
        {
          "id": "1786932056097",
          "from": "Alan Todd",
          "from_upn": null,
          "sent_utc": "2026-08-17T02:00:56.097Z",
          "sent_mt": "2026-08-16T20:00:56-06:00",
          "text": "Maria Moron Quintero, \n \nWill you please look at the schedule for Monday and Tuesday? I am sure you are modifying for ML2 and Ml3 already.\n \nML2 will run 1st shift tomorrow to finish the Crunch order and then clean. \n \nML3 will clean tomorrow and start up on 1st shift on Tuesday for the HER Caramel.\n \nPlease add 2 hours for cleaning for both lines to give us time to dial in before adding the caramel to help reduce scrap.",
          "importance": "normal",
          "web_url": null
        }
      ]
    },
